(cell "V ELIGE" "N2" "Given every gate proven, NON, ET, VEL and AUT, beside NON-ET. Write y in J3.")
(cell "V ELIGE" "N3" "A choice made by a wire: s decides which input the lamp follows, and nothing else.")
(cell "V ELIGE" "N7" "Space toggles the switch the selection stands on, 1 and 0 set it, a click toggles it; T tests, R resets, N and P move.")
