(cell "VII SEMIS" "N2" "Given every gate proven.")
(cell "VII SEMIS" "N3" "Calculemus, said Leibniz: let us calculate, and a dispute is settled. Here a sum is two gates.")
(cell "VII SEMIS" "N7" "Space toggles the switch the selection stands on, 1 and 0 set it, a click toggles it; T tests, R resets, N and P move.")
(cell "VII SEMIS" "N10" "A switch or a lamp written over is lost until Load, which loads every level afresh: R writes values, never a formula.")
