(formula "VII SEMIS" "N9" "=IF(Lab!N17=1,\"Calculemus: input \"&(Lab!$B$6+1)&\" of 4\",IF(Lab!B17=1,\"Quod erat demonstrandum: every one of its 4 inputs passes.\",IF(Lab!B17=2,\"The test stops at input \"&(Lab!C17+1)&\" of 4, standing on the board: a lamp differs from its due.\",\"T tests every input, an input a frame. Calculemus!\")))")
