(cell "IX QUATTUOR" "N2" "Given every gate proven, and the whole sum's idea four times over.")
(cell "IX QUATTUOR" "N3" "The carry ripples from bit to bit: 15 + 1 runs it through all four. T tries all 512 inputs, an input a frame.")
(cell "IX QUATTUOR" "N4" "The Liar: a gate that reads itself says this sentence is false, and the language refuses its write, naming its cells.")
(cell "IX QUATTUOR" "N7" "Space toggles the switch the selection stands on, 1 and 0 set it, a click toggles it; T tests, R resets, N and P move.")
